    "body": "The first-submission manuscript by **Peter Chocian, Independent researcher**, dated 15 September 2026, with the complete computational companion. No arXiv submission has been made. Earlier version labels identify computational releases, not previous arXiv papers by the author.\r\n\r\n- **Read the paper:** PRIMITIVE_357_PETER_CHOCIAN.pdf (36 pages).\r\n- **For arXiv:** PRIMITIVE_357_ARXIV_SOURCE_PETER_CHOCIAN_V1.zip (35,879 bytes), containing the two LaTeX source files.\r\n- **For reproducing and reviewing the computations:** PRIMITIVE_357_FIRST_SUBMISSION_COMPANION_V1.zip (601,649,354 bytes). This large companion belongs on GitHub; it is not the arXiv upload.\r\n\r\nThe companion includes the unchanged sealed computational release, the mathematical argument audit and corrections, seven fresh Magma jobs with four negative controls, and the canonical paper. The audit records 118 grouped claims and 70 imported dependencies; no project-specific gap remained identified at the level reviewed. Two manuscript errors were corrected, and an archival prose erratum was recorded. The final editorial changes preserve the audited mathematical text.\r\n\r\nThe earlier clean computational replay is preserved with its exact input identities. The new companion was separately extracted and its 17 component-file checksums verified; that packaging check is an integrity check, not a new arithmetic replay. Published results and the specified mathematical software remain dependencies. This is not proof-assistant certification or external human peer review.\r\n\r\nUse SHA256SUMS.txt to check the downloaded assets. GitHub’s automatically generated source archives contain only the smaller control repository, not the full computational companion. Previous releases and their original checksums remain unchanged."
